# BetterSpring · 仓库级忽略规则
# 工程级规则见 campus/.gitignore

### 构建产物 ###
target/
build/
out/
*.jar
*.war
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

### IDE ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project
nbproject/

### 日志 ###
*.log
logs/

### 本地敏感配置（真实密码绝不入库）###
.env
.env.local
application-local.yml
application-local.properties
*-secret.yml

### 上传目录（Lv20 起）###
upload/

### 运行时临时文件 ###
*.pid
*.tmp
*.bak
~$*

### OS ###
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
